{
  "name": "Driver Incident Report",
  "version": "1.2",
  "description": "Driver submits a field incident (accident, cargo damage, theft). Ops assessment and finance estimate run in parallel; the case is summarised and closed only after both are done. Exercises: parallel fork/join, timer escalation. Escalation follows D-ESC: timer -> higher role -> fail closed (ISS-1007 / Q-989; BA ruling GH #2281). ops-assessment (role-ops-manager, P1D) -> escalate-ops-assessment-to-ceo (role-ceo, P1D) -> stalled: ops-auto-close notice; finance-estimate (role-accountant, P1D) -> escalate-finance-estimate-to-ceo (role-ceo, P1D) -> stalled: finance-auto-close notice. A stalled branch never marks the incident assessed or costed; it rejoins parallel-join through its notice node. The injury gate defaults toward more scrutiny: an absent or unrecognised injury_involved value takes the safety notification. v1.1 (GH #2933) drops the v1.0 ops-escalation-timer TIMER branch (e12/e13): it fed parallel-join, so the AND-join waited a full P1D even when both tasks completed; ops-assessment already carries its own escalation timer. v1.2 (REQ-530, GH #3086; process audit T-0295, EO-003): the people-steps had no form, so assessment_notes and estimated_cost_eur could not be entered. ops-assessment and escalate-ops-assessment-to-ceo carry a form with assessment_notes (string, required); finance-estimate and escalate-finance-estimate-to-ceo carry a form with estimated_cost_eur (number, minimum 0, required) and finance_notes (string, optional). The required fields are declared as required_outputs (a completion without them is refused 422 output_refused) and typed in variable_schemas. The stalled branch is unchanged: its notices produce neither value. QA deployment payload (ISS-1022 / Q-1004, GH #2294); the simulation copy is test/fixtures/simulation/swiftroute/process_shipment_dispatch.yaml and the two are kept in step by test/letflow/scripts/swiftroute_incident_qa_fixture_test.exs.",
  "graph": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "start",
        "node_type": "START"
      },
      {
        "id": "injury-check",
        "node_type": "EXCLUSIVE_GATEWAY"
      },
      {
        "id": "injury-check-merge",
        "node_type": "EXCLUSIVE_GATEWAY"
      },
      {
        "id": "safety-notification",
        "node_type": "SERVICE_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "endpoint": "https://httpbin.org/anything/webhooks/safety-alert",
          "method": "POST",
          "timeout_ms": 300000
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "parallel-fork",
        "node_type": "PARALLEL_GATEWAY"
      },
      {
        "id": "ops-assessment",
        "node_type": "HUMAN_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "role": "role-ops-manager",
          "escalation_timer_duration": "P1D",
          "escalation_role": "role-ceo",
          "required_outputs": ["assessment_notes"],
          "form_schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "assessment_notes": {
                "type": "string",
                "title": "Assessment",
                "description": "Operations Manager assessment of the incident: what happened and what must be done next. Required; the incident record keeps it."
              }
            },
            "required": ["assessment_notes"]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "escalate-ops-assessment-to-ceo",
        "node_type": "HUMAN_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "role": "role-ceo",
          "description": "top of chain: escalation_role is nominal; stalled = fail closed",
          "escalation_timer_duration": "P1D",
          "escalation_role": "role-ceo",
          "required_outputs": ["assessment_notes"],
          "form_schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "assessment_notes": {
                "type": "string",
                "title": "Assessment",
                "description": "CEO assessment of the incident, escalated from Operations: what happened and what must be done next. Required; the incident record keeps it."
              }
            },
            "required": ["assessment_notes"]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "finance-estimate",
        "node_type": "HUMAN_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "role": "role-accountant",
          "escalation_timer_duration": "P1D",
          "escalation_role": "role-ceo",
          "required_outputs": ["estimated_cost_eur"],
          "form_schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "estimated_cost_eur": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0,
                "title": "Estimated cost (EUR)",
                "description": "Estimated cost of the incident in euro. Required; zero is a valid estimate."
              },
              "finance_notes": {
                "type": "string",
                "title": "Finance notes",
                "description": "Optional notes on how the estimate was reached."
              }
            },
            "required": ["estimated_cost_eur"]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "escalate-finance-estimate-to-ceo",
        "node_type": "HUMAN_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "role": "role-ceo",
          "description": "top of chain: escalation_role is nominal; stalled = fail closed",
          "escalation_timer_duration": "P1D",
          "escalation_role": "role-ceo",
          "required_outputs": ["estimated_cost_eur"],
          "form_schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "estimated_cost_eur": {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0,
                "title": "Estimated cost (EUR)",
                "description": "Estimated cost of the incident in euro, escalated from Finance. Required; zero is a valid estimate."
              },
              "finance_notes": {
                "type": "string",
                "title": "Finance notes",
                "description": "Optional notes on how the estimate was reached."
              }
            },
            "required": ["estimated_cost_eur"]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ops-auto-close",
        "node_type": "SERVICE_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "endpoint": "https://httpbin.org/anything/internal/incidents/{{variables.incident_id}}/ops-timeout",
          "method": "POST",
          "timeout_ms": 300000
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "finance-auto-close",
        "node_type": "SERVICE_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "endpoint": "https://httpbin.org/anything/internal/incidents/{{variables.incident_id}}/finance-timeout",
          "method": "POST",
          "timeout_ms": 300000
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "parallel-join",
        "node_type": "PARALLEL_GATEWAY"
      },
      {
        "id": "case-summary",
        "node_type": "SERVICE_TASK",
        "attributes": {
          "endpoint": "https://httpbin.org/anything/internal/incidents/{{variables.incident_id}}/close",
          "method": "POST",
          "timeout_ms": 300000
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "end",
        "node_type": "END"
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "id": "e0",
        "source": "start",
        "target": "injury-check"
      },
      {
        "id": "e1",
        "source": "injury-check",
        "target": "safety-notification",
        "condition": "variables.injury_involved == true"
      },
      {
        "id": "e2",
        "source": "injury-check",
        "target": "injury-check-merge",
        "condition": "variables.injury_involved == false"
      },
      {
        "id": "injury-check-default",
        "source": "injury-check",
        "target": "safety-notification",
        "is_default": true
      },
      {
        "id": "e3",
        "source": "safety-notification",
        "target": "injury-check-merge"
      },
      {
        "id": "e3b",
        "source": "injury-check-merge",
        "target": "parallel-fork",
        "is_default": true
      },
      {
        "id": "e4",
        "source": "parallel-fork",
        "target": "ops-assessment"
      },
      {
        "id": "e5",
        "source": "parallel-fork",
        "target": "finance-estimate"
      },
      {
        "id": "e6",
        "source": "ops-assessment",
        "target": "parallel-join",
        "condition": "true"
      },
      {
        "id": "timeout-ops-assessment",
        "source": "ops-assessment",
        "target": "escalate-ops-assessment-to-ceo"
      },
      {
        "id": "e6-escalated",
        "source": "escalate-ops-assessment-to-ceo",
        "target": "parallel-join",
        "condition": "true"
      },
      {
        "id": "timeout-escalate-ops-assessment-to-ceo",
        "source": "escalate-ops-assessment-to-ceo",
        "target": "ops-auto-close"
      },
      {
        "id": "e7",
        "source": "ops-auto-close",
        "target": "parallel-join"
      },
      {
        "id": "e8",
        "source": "finance-estimate",
        "target": "parallel-join",
        "condition": "true"
      },
      {
        "id": "timeout-finance-estimate",
        "source": "finance-estimate",
        "target": "escalate-finance-estimate-to-ceo"
      },
      {
        "id": "e8-escalated",
        "source": "escalate-finance-estimate-to-ceo",
        "target": "parallel-join",
        "condition": "true"
      },
      {
        "id": "timeout-escalate-finance-estimate-to-ceo",
        "source": "escalate-finance-estimate-to-ceo",
        "target": "finance-auto-close"
      },
      {
        "id": "e9",
        "source": "finance-auto-close",
        "target": "parallel-join"
      },
      {
        "id": "e10",
        "source": "parallel-join",
        "target": "case-summary"
      },
      {
        "id": "e11",
        "source": "case-summary",
        "target": "end"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable_schemas": [
    {
      "variable_key": "injury_involved",
      "json_schema": {
        "type": "boolean"
      }
    },
    {
      "variable_key": "assessment_notes",
      "json_schema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    {
      "variable_key": "estimated_cost_eur",
      "json_schema": {
        "type": "number",
        "minimum": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "variable_key": "finance_notes",
      "json_schema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    }
  ]
}
